        "TileImage": "$($repository 8fd3d13a-6e7a-4f13-a096-1349d7a5892b).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your target is overly ambitious United States attorney; Keith McKenzie. Mr McKenzie is particularly infamous in law circles for his absolute willingness to commit any number of heinous acts in the pursuit of his goals.\r\rOur client, a former firefighter charged with starting a fire that killed 15 people, believes he was framed by McKenzie in order to eliminate a potential witness.\r\rOur client&apos;s wish is for true justice to be served, and the ICA is happy to oblige. Good luck, 47.",
